Kit overlays (repo root):
  0xdfi -- GLM-5.2-Harness-O14-4x-DGX-Spark (Apache-2.0): the O14 overlay set
    this kit descends from, and the probe battery protocol probe.py implements.
    https://github.com/0xdfi/GLM-5.2-Harness-O14-4x-DGX-Spark
  CosmicRaisins -- glm-5.2-gb10 (Apache-2.0): the adaptive-MTP overlays under
    overlays/vllm/v1/spec_decode/dynamic/ are carried verbatim from their repo
    (commit-pinned in each file header), themselves a forward-port of the
    acceptance-length controller from local-inference-lab/vllm (Luke Alonso),
    with Aiden Le's acceptance-length adaptation in the lineage.
    https://github.com/CosmicRaisins/glm-5.2-gb10
  local-inference-lab -- b12x (pip package): the CuTe-DSL sparse-MLA and
    indexer kernels for GB10 / sm_121a, and the vLLM fork lineage the
    acceptance-length controller descends from.
  vLLM project and contributors (Apache-2.0), base image
    vllm/vllm-openai:v0.27.0.

Consolidated subdirectories (each carries its own NOTICE / provenance file):
  quanttrio-tp4-dcp2/ -- legacy-stack deployment. Credit chain in its NOTICE:
    CosmicRaisins (Triton sparse-MLA kernels, draft-quant patch, adaptive-MTP
    forward-port), ciprianveg (mod scripts, sparse-MLA + DeepGEMM-bypass),
    tonyd2wild (kernel redistribution, indexer-MTP fix, NVFP4 KV port),
    penguinchang (decode-aware scheduler lineage), Aiden Le (acceptance-length
