  aeon-crossnode-graphs/ -- AEON-image record. Credit chain in its NOTICE:
    AEON-7 (vllm-ultimate-dgx-spark rebuild), 0xdfi, local-inference-lab/b12x,
    bird (weight_utils overlay, DSpark ring-drafting), vLLM contributors,
    QuantTrio and NVIDIA (checkpoints).
  campaign-2026-08/sircl/ -- vendored full tree of FujitsuPolycom's SparkRing
    SIRCL transport (Apache-2.0), with its upstream LICENSE, NOTICE (including
    NVIDIA NCCL portions), and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md intact.
    https://github.com/FujitsuPolycom/sparkring
  dspark-training/ -- bird's GLM-spark speculator-training pipeline
    (Apache-2.0), provenance in dspark-training/PROVENANCE.md, including
