Model weights served or referenced: QuantTrio (GLM-5.2 Int4-Int8Mix unpruned),
NVIDIA (modelopt NVFP4 GLM-5.2), brandonmusic (GLM-5.2 EXL3 3.5-bpw,
referenced in campaign records).

Benchmark tooling: llm-decode-bench by local-inference-lab (MIT) is the
instrument named in campaign performance comparisons; probe.py is an
independent stdlib implementation of 0xdfi's published protocol.

Errors of integration are ours, not the upstream authors'.
